[00:00] [scene:intro]
VISUAL: Sonny Cirasuolo speaking to the camera.
AUDIO: 'And we\'ve done a pilot with uh the high regency tameyak. It\'s the first 3D GS tour for a hospital or major hospitality brand in the world. Right now um all of them except the aerial view are done with the portal cam and they\'re also done with HD enhancement feature. So we'

[00:12] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'found that just doing a normal portal cam scan was not enough and we lacking detail. Those spaces look stunning. But when it comes to 3DGS the question is often the same. Yes, they are amazing but what can you do with it? Sunonny has'

[00:26] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'built story splot to answer that specific question and build a platform nicely positioned between Google slide and a 3D engine to help creators like you tell compelling story around their beautiful splats. We will look at all'

[00:39] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'the unique possibilities offered by story splat. Everybody can start for free. So we have a custom shader system to do splat relighting here. And if we go ahead and change this light type to a spotlight, you can see now we have a'

[00:52] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'movable light um without having any proxy mesh. I also learned that Sunonny has a background as a journalist and we explore use cases beyond the usual construction heritage and real estate. &gt;&gt; Journalists don\'t really know how to use'

[01:06] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: '3D editing tools usually um and you need to be able to do this relatively quickly. And of course, we will dive into the tour the team has built for the Hayatt and how the team managed to go beyond pretty spaces and generate'

[01:19] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'business value. So, we have uh heat maps of where people are looking at in the space. We know every single button they clicked on. One of the the biggest selling features that they asked for. But before we get into it, I wanted to'

[01:34] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'remind you that if you don\'t have the time to watch the full interview and want to learn from other founders and creative at the intersection between XR and AI, you should definitely check out the XREI spotlight newsletter. By subscribing, you will get weekly'

[01:47] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'interviews like this directly in your inbox and access to a list of tools [music] and apps that allow you to experience cautious splatting in VR on Quest and Vision Pro. Just check the first link in the show description. And'

