AUDIO: 'now [music] it\'s time to roll the title and welcome Sunny under the spotlight. [music] &gt;&gt; Sunny, it is a real pleasure to have you'

[02:18] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'here. &gt;&gt; It\'s a pleasure to be here. Thank you for having me. &gt;&gt; So Sunny, everybody is excited about getting this gosh plotting on the web and storyplot could be the solution for that. So what is storyplat?'

[02:31] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: '&gt;&gt; Yeah. So storyplat simply put is a tool that lets you create the final product uh for what like your gosh splat can be. So like if you want to create an'

[02:43] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'interactive tour, you want to create a storytelling piece. Um, it\'s used for journalism, real estate, hospitality, but traditionally you take a scan and you just get a really pretty blob and that blob is a gosh and splat and'

[02:55] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'there\'s nothing to do with it other than just upload it and really share it with somebody else that also knows how to navigate a 3D GS scene or a traditional 3D scene. Um, and when you send it to somebody like my grandma per se, she has'

[03:08] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'no idea what to do with it. And the idea is with storyplat you can create these rich interactive experiences that tell a story but also guide a user through uh a journey um and lets them actually'

[03:20] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'experience spatial media in a way that\'s accessible. So there are let\'s say uh several attempts in different ways at creating something like this. So what would you'

[03:33] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'say are the things that set Story Splat aside from something that maybe people might be very familiar with like uh Super Splat being like the database of Goshlati for example &gt;&gt; of course um and Super Splat is great'

[03:45] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'and uh you know they\'ve been along my side this entire journey um and I encourage people to actually go and upload things on Supplat sometimes if all they want to do is just simply upload it and be able to share it really'

