[15:57] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'couldn\'t have felt otherwise. And and it really worked. So splats are super powerful for that, too. Whether that be bringing people somewhere, making space legible, however that be. And and I think that these larger newsrooms can'

